John Kilgore is a dwarven Bishop, Second Class, and a handler of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]]. He wears the convox's maroon red, and he is a haggard man who will go days without sleep and keeps his face still.

He hands operatives their dossiers and their gear before a mission and tells them no more than they need. For the [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]] he supplied a crude map of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/Orilon/index|Orilon]], the beacon, and three vials of brown sludge that make a follower's raiment look silver for ten minutes, and he called the work simple without saying whether anyone was expected to come back.
